<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers firm, some mainly Choice $0.50 higher.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 73.00-75.00, those at 75.00 mostly Choice. Select 71.00-73.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to largely Choice 2-4 1000-1250 lbs 73.00-75.00. Select 71.00-73.00.</p>
</text>
